---@field instanceAutoDnsStatus? gcp.sqladmin_v1.PscAutoConnectionConfigInstanceAutoDnsStatusEnum|string Output only. The status of automated DNS provisioning.
---@field serviceConnectionPolicyCreationResult? string Output only. The status of service connection policy creation.
---@field ipAddress? string The IP address of the consumer endpoint.
