---@field backupRun? string Output only. The mapping to backup run resource used for IAM validations.
---@field updateMask? string The list of fields that you can update. You can update only the description and retention period of the final backup.
---@field name string Output only. The resource name of the backup. Format: projects/{project}/backups/{backup}.

